sequenceDiagram
    actor Host as Authorized Host
    participant API as ScenariosController
    participant S as ScenarioService (LTP)
    participant B as AdaptiveInputSnapshotBuilder
    participant P as AEDPreMatchPolicyV1
    participant R as ScenarioConfigRegistry
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Host->>API: POST /api/matches/{id}/scenario/resolve
    API->>S: ResolvePreMatchAsync(host, match, request)
    S->>DB: Validate JWT host binding, lease and decision identity
    alt Unauthorized, stale or conflicting request
        S-->>API: Rejection / conflict
        API-->>Host: 4xx (reason-specific)
    else Existing identical valid decision
        S-->>API: Existing decision (replay)
        API-->>Host: 200 OK
    else New decision in pre-match window
        S->>B: BuildPreMatchAsync(matchId)
        B->>DB: Read roster and player AI profiles
        B-->>S: Snapshot, coverage, fingerprint
        S->>R: GetProductionFixedFallbackAsync(compatibility)
        R-->>S: Approved fixed baseline or failure
        alt No valid fixed baseline
            S-->>API: Validation failure
            API-->>Host: 4xx
        else Baseline available
            alt Request FIXED
                S->>S: FIXED_CONFIG_ISSUED
            else Request ADAPTIVE, policy disabled
                S->>S: FIXED_FALLBACK / POLICY_CONFIG_INVALID
            else Request ADAPTIVE, policy enabled
                S->>S: Validate policy contract / whitelist / parameter registry
                alt Invalid policy or parameters
                    S->>S: FIXED_FALLBACK / POLICY_CONFIG_INVALID
                else Policy valid
                    S->>P: SelectRule(snapshot, thresholds)
                    alt Incomplete / invalid player evidence
                        S->>S: FIXED_FALLBACK / INPUT_INVALID
                    else Mixed HOLD rule
                        S->>S: FIXED_FALLBACK / HOLD_RULE
                    else Relief or Increase rule
                        S->>R: GetProductionAdaptiveCandidatesAsync(compatibility)
                        R-->>S: Approved compatible candidates or failure
                        S->>S: AEDPreMatchCandidateV1.TrySelect(rule, baseline, candidates)
                        alt Exactly one approved next-value candidate
                            S->>S: ADAPTIVE_CONFIG_ISSUED; fallback=false
                        else No unique valid candidate
                            S->>S: FIXED_FALLBACK / selection reason
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
            S->>DB: Commit snapshot and ScenarioDecision atomically
            S-->>API: Decision and selected configuration
            API-->>Host: 201 Created
        end
    end
    Note over S,DB: Policy Enabled=false in LTP appsettings.json; true in Development override.
    Note over Host,API: Config application is acknowledged separately by ConfirmAppliedAsync.
